---- MODULE BlenderBot ----
\* Generated by chart-to-tla.mjs from blender-bot.mmd.
\* Each region is one variable and each transition label is one action.
\* Once you add guards and variables from the real code, this file is the source.
\* statechart.mjs from-chart blender-bot.mmd keeps it, checks it, and compares it with the chart.

VARIABLES main
vars == <<main>>

\* Region Main
mainStates == {"Accepted", "Assigned", "Blocked", "Disposed", "Escalated", "Executing", "Failed", "GateChecked", "Probing", "Proposed", "ReviewPending", "Started", "Verified"}

TypeOK ==
    /\ main \in mainStates

Init ==
    /\ main = "Started"

\* owner posts job packet
OwnerPostsJobPacket ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Started" /\ main' = "Assigned")

\* gather app state (bpy / visual)
GatherAppStateBpyVisual ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Probing" /\ main' = "Probing")

\* required input missing
RequiredInputMissing ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Probing" /\ main' = "Blocked")

\* coordinator supplies input
CoordinatorSuppliesInput ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Blocked" /\ main' = "Probing")

\* action written + hashed
ActionWrittenHashed ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Probing" /\ main' = "Proposed")

\* decision service evaluates
DecisionServiceEvaluates ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Proposed" /\ main' = "GateChecked")

\* abstain; re-propose with more state
AbstainReProposeWithMoreState ==
    /\ \/ (main = "GateChecked" /\ main' = "GateChecked")

\* accept AND permission AND freshness AND idempotency
AcceptANDPermissionANDFreshnessANDIdempotency ==
    /\ \/ (main = "GateChecked" /\ main' = "Executing")

\* reject; revise proposal
RejectReviseProposal ==
    /\ \/ (main = "GateChecked" /\ main' = "Proposed")

\* abstain AND operator override
AbstainANDOperatorOverride ==
    /\ \/ (main = "GateChecked" /\ main' = "Executing")

\* tool streams
ToolStreams ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Executing" /\ main' = "Executing")

\* state probed; checks pass
StateProbedChecksPass ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Executing" /\ main' = "Verified")

\* tool error OR check fail
ToolErrorORCheckFail ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Executing" /\ main' = "Failed")

\* diagnose from evidence (max 2 retries)
DiagnoseFromEvidenceMax2Retries ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Failed" /\ main' = "Proposed")

\* retries exhausted; report owner
RetriesExhaustedReportOwner ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Failed" /\ main' = "Escalated")

\* evidence + receipts written
EvidenceReceiptsWritten ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Verified" /\ main' = "ReviewPending")

\* owner reviews; pass recorded
OwnerReviewsPassRecorded ==
    /\ \/ (main = "ReviewPending" /\ main' = "Accepted")

\* owner confirms bad; trash per rule
OwnerConfirmsBadTrashPerRule ==
    /\ \/ (main = "ReviewPending" /\ main' = "Disposed")

\* owner redirects with new constraint
OwnerRedirectsWithNewConstraint ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Escalated" /\ main' = "Proposed")

Next == OwnerPostsJobPacket \/ GatherAppStateBpyVisual \/ RequiredInputMissing \/ CoordinatorSuppliesInput \/ ActionWrittenHashed \/ DecisionServiceEvaluates \/ AbstainReProposeWithMoreState \/ AcceptANDPermissionANDFreshnessANDIdempotency \/ RejectReviseProposal \/ AbstainANDOperatorOverride \/ ToolStreams \/ StateProbedChecksPass \/ ToolErrorORCheckFail \/ DiagnoseFromEvidenceMax2Retries \/ RetriesExhaustedReportOwner \/ EvidenceReceiptsWritten \/ OwnerReviewsPassRecorded \/ OwnerConfirmsBadTrashPerRule \/ OwnerRedirectsWithNewConstraint

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars

====
